  "observations": "Observation: Limited. The attempt remained active through time 12.4 with 70 HP. A safe route reached approximately (8.5, 6.0) via the west corridor, north of the records wall, around its east edge, and below the divider. After R2 appeared near (14.26, 5.2) heading west, retreating west and then south ended at (6.5, 8.5). R1 was last observed near (3.1, 6.66) heading north, and R2 near (11.36, 5.2) heading west.",
  "failure": "Observation: The exit was not reached because the result was token_budget while the player was still active. Hypothesis: Excessive waiting, retreating, and route reversal consumed the available reasoning budget without producing enough progress. Lesson: Commit to a mapped safe corridor instead of repeatedly undoing progress.",
  "next": "Next strategy: Repeat the verified opening to reach the area below the divider, but pause before entering R2's west-facing corridor. After R2 passes west, cross east behind it using short moves, go north around the divider's east side, and approach the exit from x greater than 8.9.",
  "uncertainty": "R2's sight range, patrol endpoints, and reversal timing remain unknown. It is also uncertain whether the spine wall fully blocks R2's view from the southern side and whether additional robots guard the final northern approach."
}

